{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The third of seven chapters of a courtroom battle style visual novel, in which the story follows brand new lawyer Samuel Prince as he solves a strange variety of different crimes. Acquire evidence by investigating the crime scene, then use it in court when cross examining witnesses to cleave through all the lies and find your way to the truth. Use your head to point out contradictions between the testimony and the facts in order to get your client declared innocent and deliver justice to those who really deserve it. In this chapter, Samuel Prince becomes newly acquainted with a senior college student, but a new case ends up enveloping the both of them.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chapter 3 Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4056220/41e94bd4bb8003a7fa7b36564498abf2fcb9d3b6.jpg"},{"name":"Check Your Profile","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4056220/1c71876a0f55b4d86452eb283d498e7832b65bed.jpg"},{"name":"Atlas Withdrawal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4056220/62afb8c029566f402ba6bf9e2833c564f957765c.jpg"},{"name":"My Work Here Is Done","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4056220/2da9c4a191f3a636e384ca9d5017df9836eae7d0.jpg"},{"name":"Warming Up To Each Other","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4056220/0696ceb8193218e7fecd65c45737ab423651c07f.jpg"},{"name":"Judge the Judge?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4056220/7ccf7bcad8788a2366f7bed20d1c0d17b99bb765.jpg"},{"name":"Melted Ice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4056220/996e1efc801e342bf6fdd366da3ae4339ed2b26b.jpg"},{"name":"Super I'm Too Tired For This","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4056220/68bc0e03c6